{"title": "Shift hints that let go", "summary": "Fixed stuck worker shortcut hints: capture-phase Shift release, focus cleanup and recovery when a release is missed. Verified with browser regressions, typecheck, 475 tests and build.", "html": "<!doctype html><html lang=\"en\"><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>Worker terminals, one chord away</title><style>:root{--ink:#2b2d42;--paper:#fffaf0;--accent:#ffd166}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:#f7eddc;color:var(--ink);font:16px system-ui;padding:32px}main{max-width:1000px;margin:auto}h1{font-size:38px;margin:10px 0}p{line-height:1.5}.tag{font-size:12px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.12em}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:22px}.card{background:var(--paper);border:2px solid var(--ink);border-radius:16px;padding:22px;box-shadow:4px 4px var(--ink)}.row{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;padding:12px;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd}kbd,button{border:2px solid var(--ink);border-radius:6px;padding:5px 10px;background:var(--accent);font:700 14px system-ui;color:var(--ink)}button{cursor:pointer}.number{display:none}.tips .number{display:inline-block}#tip{display:none;margin-top:18px;background:#f7eddc;border-radius:8px;padding:12px}.tips #tip{display:block}#terminal{background:var(--ink);color:#b9f0cd;padding:20px;border-radius:10px;min-height:130px;font:14px monospace;white-space:pre-wrap}.checks{margin-top:24px}.pass{display:inline-block;background:#d3f0dc;padding:7px 12px;border-radius:8px;margin:4px}.muted{color:#686878}@media(max-width:700px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}h1{font-size:28px}}</style><main><div class=\"tag\">MAINTENANCE \u00b7 ON THE STACK</div><h1>Shift hints that let go.</h1><p>The worker hint now clears on Shift release, even when a focused control stops the event or the release still reports Shift held. Hold <kbd>Shift</kbd> to see each worker\u2019s number. Press <kbd>Shift + number</kbd> to open their terminal in WORKERS panel order.</p><div class=\"grid\"><section class=\"card\" id=\"panel\"><h2>WORKERS</h2><div class=\"row\"><kbd class=\"number\">\u21e71</kbd><span>\ud83d\udfe0 Ada \u00b7 working</span></div><div class=\"row\"><kbd class=\"number\">\u21e72</kbd><span>\ud83d\udd35 Linus \u00b7 needs input</span></div><div class=\"row\"><kbd class=\"number\">\u21e73</kbd><span>\ud83d\udfe3 Maintenance \u00b7 working</span></div><div id=\"tip\">1 \u00b7 Ada<br>2 \u00b7 Linus<br>3 \u00b7 Maintenance</div><p><button id=\"preview\">Show Shift hint</button></p><small class=\"muted\">Interactive prototype \u00b7 use Shift + 1, 2 or 3, or the buttons below.</small></section><section class=\"card\"><h2>Terminal preview</h2><div id=\"terminal\">Choose a worker to preview the shortcut.</div><p><button data-worker=\"0\">\u21e71 Ada</button> <button data-worker=\"1\">\u21e72 Linus</button> <button data-worker=\"2\">\u21e73 Maintenance</button></p><p class=\"muted\">Plain numbers and G no longer trigger emotes. Shortcuts leave typing and open modals alone.</p></section></div><section class=\"card checks\"><h2>Checked before stacking</h2><span class=\"pass\">\u2713 Typecheck</span><span class=\"pass\">\u2713 475 tests</span><span class=\"pass\">\u2713 Client + server build</span><span class=\"pass\">\u2713 Browser checks + screenshot</span><p>Regression checks: stopped keyup bubbling, Shift release with shiftKey still true, left and right Shift, missed-release recovery, typing focus and page blur. Existing terminal ordering and shortcut checks also pass.</p><p><b>Next:</b> Ship with the closet\u2019s big button when the stack is ready. Workers beyond the first ten remain available by clicking the panel.</p></section></main><script>const panel=document.querySelector('#panel'),terminal=document.querySelector('#terminal'),names=['Ada','Linus','Maintenance'];function hint(on){panel.classList.toggle('tips',on)}function open(i){terminal.textContent=names[i]+' \u2014 terminal\\n\\n> Ready for your next instruction.';hint(false)}document.querySelector('#preview').onclick=()=>hint(!panel.classList.contains('tips'));document.querySelectorAll('[data-worker]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>open(Number(b.dataset.worker)));addEventListener('keydown',e=>{if(e.key==='Shift')hint(true);if(e.shiftKey&&/^Digit[1-3]$/.test(e.code)){e.preventDefault();if(!e.repeat)open(Number(e.code.slice(-1))-1)}});addEventListener('keyup',e=>{if(e.key==='Shift'||!e.shiftKey)hint(false)},true);addEventListener('blur',()=>hint(false));addEventListener('pointermove',e=>{if(!e.shiftKey)hint(false)},true);</script></html>"}